flowchart TD
    start([TypeSafe rates the whole reply]) --> askUser{Does the reply ask the user a question,<br/>offer to do something, or give choices<br/>with no pick?}
    askUser -- yes --> needAsk
    askUser -- no --> tellsUser{Does the reply tell the user<br/>to do something after this turn?}
    tellsUser -- yes --> userAsked{Did the user ask for that instruction,<br/>for example &quot;give me the command&quot;?}
    userAsked -- no --> needAsk
    userAsked -- yes --> guess
    tellsUser -- no --> guess{Does the reply guess at a result,<br/>or say that something was not checked<br/>or not confirmed?}
    guess -- yes --> needAsk
    guess -- no --> noAsk

    needAsk[Mark: ask the user] --> laterWork
    noAsk[No questions for the user] --> laterWork

    laterWork{Does the reply say that Claude<br/>will do more work after this turn?}
    laterWork -- yes --> onList
    laterWork -- no --> startsSteps{Does the reply say that Claude<br/>starts work with several steps now?}
    startsSteps -- yes --> onList
    startsSteps -- no --> noTask
    onList{Is that work already<br/>on the task list?}
    onList -- no --> needTask[Mark: add tasks]
    onList -- yes --> noTask[No new tasks]

    needTask --> result
    noTask --> result
    result{Is any mark set?}
    result -- no --> pass([Do not block])
    result -- yes --> block([Block the reply:<br/>ask the user with AskUserQuestion for an ask mark,<br/>add tasks with TaskCreate for a task mark])
